# Base URL the frontend calls for the API. In Docker Compose this is proxied
# by nginx; in local `vite dev` it's proxied by the Vite dev server (see
# vite.config.ts) so this can usually be left as the relative default.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1

# Which AI Analysis backend the page talks to. "analyze" (default) is the
# hybrid, tool-grounded engine (POST /datasets/{id}/analyze). "ask" is the
# older, unvalidated single-query path (POST /datasets/{id}/ask) — kept
# reachable but deprecated; see docs/AI_ANALYTICS.md's "Deprecated: /ask".
# VITE_AI_ANALYST_ENGINE=analyze
